      "text": "APIs:\n[uid retrieved from JWT/Session cookies]\n\n\nPOST /v1/upload/ (authenticated)\n{\n    Video,\n    VideoMetadata: (name, description, categories, )\n}\n\n\nGET /v1/videos/:videoId\n->\n{\n        Video,\n        VideoMetadata\n}",
