      "text": "Non Functional Requirements:\n\n- C >> A, for video uploads\n- Resumable video uploads\n- Low latency streaming, even on low bandwidth\nconnections\n- Scaling for high number of videos uploaded & watched\n(1M video uploads & 100M views / day)\n- Uploading & streaming large video files (10+ Gb)",
