      "seed": 1295547544,
      "version": 203,
      "versionNonce": 1573541771,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1768924096485,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GOOD SOLUTION: Store different video formats\n\n\n→ Once user uploads a video, S3 will fire an event notification to video\nprocessing service\n→ Service will convert original into different formats, & store each\nformat as a file in S3\n→ Also update VideoMetadata record with file URLs for each format\n\nChallenges\n→ Fails to anticipate need to store small segments of video for\nstreaming later\n→ No way for a client to download \"part\" of a video, which is very\nimportant for video streaming\n\n\n\nGREAT SOLUTION: Store different video formats as segments\n\n\n→ Post-process videos by splitting into small segments (each a playable\nunit, few seconds in length) & then converts each segment to different\nformats (playable on different devices).\n\n\nChallenges\n→ Fails to anticipate need to store small segments of video for\nstreaming later\n→ No way for a client to download \"part\" of a video, which is very\nimportant for video streaming",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "uY9rZB-DyCGD6MBzmEoXi",
      "originalText": "GOOD SOLUTION: Store different video formats\n\n\n→ Once user uploads a video, S3 will fire an event notification to video processing service\n→ Service will convert original into different formats, & store each format as a file in S3\n→ Also update VideoMetadata record with file URLs for each format\n\nChallenges\n→ Fails to anticipate need to store small segments of video for streaming later\n→ No way for a client to download \"part\" of a video, which is very important for video streaming\n\n\n\nGREAT SOLUTION: Store different video formats as segments\n\n\n→ Post-process videos by splitting into small segments (each a playable unit, few seconds in length) & then converts each segment to different formats (playable on different devices).\n\n\nChallenges\n→ Fails to anticipate need to store small segments of video for streaming later\n→ No way for a client to download \"part\" of a video, which is very important for video streaming",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9ZVfE3MpUvfSKDnbl3A0f",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 7453.896443155793,
      "y": 674.0122748581059,
      "width": 664.7983243628723,
      "height": 2735,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
